  <data name="InfoTab.AboutText" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Stego Revealer is a software suite for performing steganalysis and working with steganographic methods of hiding and extracting information.

Available steganalysis methods:
    - Comprehensive Steganalysis Method;
    - Chi-Square Attack (CSA);
    - Regular-Singular (RS) Analysis;
    - Sample Pair Analysis (SPA);
    - Fast Additive Noise (FAN, HCF-COM) Method;
    - Zhilkin’s Compression Analysis (ZCA);
    - Sequential Koch–Zhao Embedding Analysis (CKZhA).

Available steganographic extraction methods:
    - LSB Method;
    - Koch–Zhao Method.

Developer: Iaroslav Grachev
Scientific Advisor: V. G. Sidorenko</value>
